Ba3tration-tester
https://github.com/beait/Ba3tration-tester

Built on mobile-agent-testers (above), whose README is kept as TESTERS.md. It adds
two security engines, one workflow that runs the three engines, and one report.
At run time the security engines fetch the SemSec rules
(https://github.com/RobustaStudio/semsec, MIT license) and run Semgrep and OWASP ZAP
from their official container images. None of them is copied into this repository.
